{"id":"e7eb620808ce373c","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md","title":"Skolem Function","display":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-skolem-function","aliases":["58-df-skolem-function"],"display":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-skolem-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-skolem-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\)</span> (universe operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\">\\(\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\)</span> (displayed variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (length of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar y\">\\(\\bar y\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}\">\\(F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}\\)</span> (function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\)</span> (object-level semantic predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\)</span> (semantic Skolem-function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar y(i)=\\bar y(j)\\to i=j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in M^n\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(\\bar y(i))=\\bar a(i))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists b\\in M\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto b])\\bigr]\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto F_\\varphi(\\bar a)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar y(i)=\\bar y(j)\\to i=j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in M^n\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(\\bar y(i))=\\bar a(i))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\to\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists b\\in M\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto b])\\bigr]\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto F_\\varphi(\\bar a)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This semantic version chooses witnesses inside a fixed structure; syntactic Skolemization instead adds a new function symbol and the corresponding universal axiom.</li>\n<li>Existential truth and the selected witness are evaluated through the registered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}\\)</span> map under explicit assignment updates; no unguarded metalinguistic satisfaction notation remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}$ (free-variable operator, see [[58-df-free-variable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar y","display":false},{"tex":"F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{\\mathfrak M}(F_\\varphi,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(\\bar y(i)=\\bar y(j)\\to i=j)\\\\\n&\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\n\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land F_\\varphi\\in M^{M^n}\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in M^n\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(\\bar y(i))=\\bar a(i))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\to\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists b\\in M\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto b])\\bigr]\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto F_\\varphi(\\bar a)])\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}","display":false}],"bytes":2536,"backlinks":[{"id":"42db21ac702cc072","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"91b4c987294d365f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md|58-df-skolem-function]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","36d7463d215be751","8b6a90316aad78a4","64f35ba2e87964e0","715a32e91161b34f"]}